 "answer_raw": "A dozen Grade A large eggs cost an average of **$2.27** as of September 2026, which is **35% cheaper** than the $3.49 average seen in September 2025 [1][3].\n\nThe price hit a low of $2.14 in June 2026 before rising slightly to the current $2.27 level [3]. For context, prices peaked at $6.23 in March  even higher than the $9.00+ seen at some retailers during the supply shortages of early 2025 [3][5].",
